        "Content": "this property combines comfortable living space with practical bedroom accommodation and excellent outdoor space, making it an ideal for those looking for a well-connected property in a convenient location.the property opens into a welcoming living room, providing a comfortable space for relaxing and entertaining. To the rear is a well-appointed kitchen and dining area, offering a practical and sociable space for everyday living and family meals. A convenient guest WC, located beneath the stairs, completes the ground floor accommodation.\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, all benefiting from useful wardrobe space. The principal bedroom further benefits from a private en-suite bathroom, while a separate family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation. Charnwood Grove is situated in the popular Clonsilla area, offering a convenient combination of residential surroundings and excellent access to local amenities. A range of shops, schools, cafés, parks and other everyday conveniences can be found within the surrounding area.\nFor commuters, the property is well positioned for access to Clonsilla Train Station, providing rail connections towards Dublin and Maynooth. The area is also well served by Dublin Bus routes, providing convenient connections throughout Dublin 15 and towards Dublin City Centre.\nThe property also benefits from easy access to the wider road network, making surrounding areas readily accessible by car."
